---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Resources">
  <h1>Resources</h1>

  <div class="resource">
    <h3><a href="https://topologicalquantumchemistry.com/">Topological Materials Database</a></h3>
    <p>
      A searchable database of the band topology of known crystalline materials, computed with topological quantum
      chemistry. It was developed by the group together with collaborators in Donostia, Bilbao and Dresden.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="resource">
    <h3><a href="https://www.cryst.ehu.es/#TQCtop">Bilbao Crystallographic Server: topological quantum chemistry</a></h3>
    <p>
      Programs for band representations, compatibility relations and topological indices, built with our colleagues
      at the University of the Basque Country.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="resource">
    <h3><a href="https://doi.org/10.1515/9781400846733">Topological Insulators and Topological Superconductors</a></h3>
    <p>
      A graduate textbook by B. A. Bernevig with T. L. Hughes (Princeton University Press, 2013).
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
